# A messy N-Triples file: tabs, runs of spaces and blank lines.
<https://example.com/ns#alice>	<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>	<https://example.com/ns#Person>.
   <https://example.com/ns#alice>   <https://example.com/ns#name>  "Alice"@en  .   # her name



<https://example.com/ns#alice> <https://example.com/ns#age> "42"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>.
_:b0	<https://example.com/ns#name>	"Bob" .
# a triple term
<https://example.com/ns#alice> <https://example.com/ns#says> <<(  _:b0 <https://example.com/ns#knows>   <https://example.com/ns#alice>  )>> .
